ived_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Works in 4.7 beta-4\n- No longer works after 4.7 beta-5\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.7.rc2 - Arch Linux on Wayland - dedicated AMD Radeon RX 6600 (RADV NAVI23) - AMD Ryzen 5 1600 Six-Core Processor\n\n### Issue description\n\nIn the animation tree, setting the `Stretch Time Scale` property on or off doesn't do anything anymore. This used to scale the animation to the custom timeline length.\n\nIn Beta 4, working as expected:\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/e441eb6f-8723-48b6-bdd3-f71c88d69b0d\n\n\nIn Beta 5 and all later versions : notice the playback bar on the two animation nodes. They have a different length and are no longer synced, resulting in jumps and broken blending.\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/b2d2b3c3-d32a-4eee-82e3-82f96ae863df\n\n\n\nI don't have a way to compile the engine right now but looking at the interactive changelog, I **assume** this comes from #119871 \n\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n+ Import a 3D model with an animation (see mrp)\n+ Create an animation tree, pointing to the animation player from the model\n+ Add an Animation Node\n+ Enable `Use custom timeline`\n+ Turn on  `Stretch Time Scale` -> nothing happens\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nMRP: \n\n[animation_stretch_timeline.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/28856922/animation_stretch_timeline.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120214/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120214/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}